@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "User" as User
participant "ShopView\n(UI)" as UI
participant "ProductService\n(Backend)" as Service
participant "ProductRepository\n(DB)" as DB

User -> UI : Access shop section
UI -> Service : getAllProducts()
activate Service

Service -> DB : findAll()
activate DB
DB --> Service : return List<Product>
deactivate DB

Service --> UI : return complete product list
deactivate Service

Note over UI: Iterate list and create\nProductCard components dynamically

UI -> User : Render catalog items layout on screen
@enduml